# W31b, b (k10): joins a in stag0201; once a stands on matz01 b plays through to the mat too (explore) and says No in its
# own prompt: the port asked b for a's departure, so b gets the offer's row without a notice.
# (It heals from the L panel at 350 HP on the way to matz01: stag0201's mummies felled W31b's b in run d1.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until present=3,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@420 fail stagechange
idle until onmat:matz01>=1 fail epoch>=@800
explore matz01 no until answered>=1 or hp<=350 fail stagechange,epoch>=@900
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 no until answered>=1 or hp<=350 fail stagechange,epoch>=@900
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 no until answered>=1 fail stagechange,epoch>=@900
log b said no
idle until offers>=1 fail notices>=1
log b has the offer without a notice
idle until frames>=1500 fail notices>=1
log b saw no notice
